  "description": "Jeanne, the royal tutor, is sentenced to death for giving Prince Mael a forbidden book. Exiled to the desolate North, she has three months to earn a pardon by persuading Duke Baldr to appoint her as Ana's tutor. But Baldr's ruthless trials—and the dangerous desires they awaken—may prove deadlier than the execution she escaped.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
